<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "bittersweet.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Mm... <STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE> had been <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="だま">deceiving</STYLE> you all along...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>! Don't you dare play the victim!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Look at the result!?
{PAUSE ""}
　We were in real danger, and so was Motoki-cho!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="4">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"And what about the people who've died until now!?
{PAUSE ""}
　They died because of <STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE> selfishness, didn't they!?
{PAUSE ""}
　That... that can never be forgiven!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't intend to make excuses. I knew from the start that what I was doing was wrong. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That day </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> suddenly killed herself, and her head was cut off―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh... <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>...! How could you...!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="4">, that's not right. I won't say </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> isn't at fault. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But this time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> just happened to be the target."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> absorbed many people, and gained that much intellect along with them. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">With that </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="こうかつ">cunning</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, manipulating </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s heart was a simple thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">―if it hadn't been him, someone else would have been manipulated the same way."</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... But...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"You could have been a target too, </STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="4">, you know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">If </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had appeared before me―</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "1"}
{PLAYMOVIE "光.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "255"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="5">, I'm sorry. Mom died, you see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\懐かしの里.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="5">"But, </STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="5">, you're the only one I've been allowed to see. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Somewhere no one is watching, just for a little while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Really...?
{PAUSE ""}
　I can really see <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>? I can keep seeing you!?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yes, it's true. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But... there's a condition. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Every year, you have to kill one person, </STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"You know that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> is suspected of being the one who killed me, don't you?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　If </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> disappears from this settlement, I can never appear before </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="5"> again."</STYLE><PG>
"No, I don't want that!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's why, </STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="5">, so we don't lose any more family, you have to get rid of the people who suspect </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You're<STYLE ID="5"> strong, so you can do it, can't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Okay..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"This is a secret just between the two of us, okay?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　You must always do it with a knife."</STYLE><PG>
"With a knife...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yes, with a knife."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地奥2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Was that just now... a daydream?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">No, it was something that had been in my memory.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">I had convinced myself that I was the culprit of the curse-killing case.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">I had been conscious that I was the culprit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Had I, too, been shown phantoms by </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">...?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had been dead a year. It was a dream I had right before the first curse-killing case happened.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">That day, I heard Shirozaki-san's wife talking about turning </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> over to the police.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">I believed </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had cut off </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s head.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">If that came out, would I lose family again?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">What could I do so I wouldn't lose any more family?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">That was what </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had told me in the dream.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">And so―though it was in a dream, I killed Shirozaki-san's wife.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Not realizing it was a dream, I went on carrying that sin.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had been sending me voices and visions, and I hadn't realized that either.</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
It seems I was just as guilty. 
{PAUSE ""}
I believed I was the curse-killing culprit. 
{PAUSE ""}
I... was the same as <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">I had that intuition―the ability to exchange words with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Through it, I had been manipulated, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">In the dream, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> appeared, and to save </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, the curse-killings...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">In reality, I never killed anyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">But so as not to lose any more family―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">―so as not to lose him, I </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="いと">did not shrink from</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> killing people.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> was someone I could have confronted, too, and yet...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Far from turning a blind eye to the curse-killing case, to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, it could even be said that I caused it.</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... I was made the scapegoat. 
{PAUSE ""}
And on top of that, it used the one person I didn't want to hand over as the culprit―
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"From </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s standpoint, if people simply died, the truth might someday come out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It needed a human who believed themselves the culprit, as a scapegoat for when the time came."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="4">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, I think you are both victims of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But the fact is, you both had no small part in the curse-killing case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I don't know whether the two of you could be prosecuted for a case like this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">No, now that the root cause no longer exists, I think even building a case would be difficult."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Just... please. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Please don't let this come between you. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">That is what would truly make </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> sad. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I want you to remember </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> at the summit, her body rotting, suffering, and still speaking to you at the end."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Think back. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You<STYLE ID="4"> believed the method you had used was stabbing, but in fact it was a beating. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Why did </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> make such a fatal mistake? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Maybe it was the tiniest hint from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and the others. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Eiichiro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> still had some human self left, after all."</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I don't know whether it really was a hint from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, or whether </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> had some other intention. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But because of it, you noticed what was odd about the curse-killing case, </STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="4">, and you were able to reach </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"If it was a hint from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, it can't have been given so that the two of you would fall out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">It was a wish that, once things were solved, the family left behind would be even a little happier. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'm sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, who was like a goddess, would want that."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">I have no right to blame anyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The person I tried to blame</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> has no reason to be blamed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">We had been captivated by a devilish cherry tree that preys on human weakness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">That's all it was.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">That's all it was, but―that sin will not go away as long as we live.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Something we must carry.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">And―something we must accept in each other.</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Let's go home together. 
{PAUSE ""}
The <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> who was here was <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> in body only. 
{PAUSE ""}
But this isn't <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>'s grave, you know?
{PAUSE ""}
　The daphne <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> loved goes on the grave where <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> is sleeping. 
{PAUSE ""}
You can't keep clinging to this forever."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">I picked up the offered </STYLE><STYLE ID="11" RUBY="じんちょうげ">daphne</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\沈丁花.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "1"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Mm... You know what daphne means in the language of flowers, don't you, <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Immortality... indestructibility... eternity..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... There's no such thing as a person who doesn't die. 
{PAUSE ""}
But <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>'s heart, and your feelings, <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>, will never disappear. 
{PAUSE ""}
If I can become even a little like <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
then I can carry on what you both felt."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Then I handed the daphne to </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... I can't take <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE>'s place, but at a time like this, what would <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> do? 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sure she'd stay close to your heart, <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>, so the person she cared about could feel even a little better. 
{PAUSE ""}
Not blaming him, but accepting her own sins, helping him move forward even a little."<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\宝石と想いを胸に_　ピアノ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Mm... Because <STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE> is our real Goddess, after all. 
{PAUSE ""}
Right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Ugh... uuugh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="うな">groan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, as if squeezed out of him.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Hearing it, I held </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> tight.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Just as </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had done for me when my green eye was cured.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ugh... never again... never again will I see </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... It's all right, <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>. I'm here. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm always on <STYLE ID="3">your</STYLE> side."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uuugh...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...! </STYLE>Chigaya<STYLE ID="3">...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">For the first time, I heard </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="おえつ">sobs</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">It was the moment I first saw what lay inside </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s heart―his weakness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Until now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had lived hiding this sorrow, this emptiness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">He understood that </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> would never appear again, and the dam in </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s heart burst.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">The curse-killing case had gone unsolved until now because of an utterly simple feeling: not wanting to lose someone you love.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> hadn't wanted to lose </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">That was all. Truly, that was all it was.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Now, instead of blaming him for it, just as </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> once did―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">yes, like the Goddess―I give the person in front of me a shoulder to cry on.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> may well be right that building a case over this would be difficult.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> did commit a sin.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">That sin will never go away.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">What would happen if the people of the settlement heard about this?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Even if everyone becomes </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s enemy, I will stand by </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s side.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Not because I bear the same sin.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">So that my precious family, the one precious to me, won't be hurt any more.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">So that nothing sad happens any more.</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE>, it's all right now. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE>'ve got me."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="14"><TXSPS>"Aaaah...!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="14">　Uaaah...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> finally lost even the strength to stand, and clinging to me, he cried out like a child.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">You don't have to hold back anymore. I'll take all of it.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
