{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">I... I can't, no matter what... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I can't leave someone who has committed a grave crime alone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="4">"But..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">With that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> laid her hand on my back.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"But... I don't know how I could ever explain this case to the police. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So I won't tell anyone about this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">So... um..."</STYLE>
