{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"So please, make this Arata settlement an even better place. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">That will be the truest memorial for the people who died, and for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">The people who died in the curse-killing case were all people who endured and didn't run, to protect this settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Everyone in the Arata settlement is brave, after all."</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'll make this an even better place, you'll see. 
{PAUSE ""}
So that <STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE>'ll want to come here again."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Yes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... Thank you, <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE>. For helping us from start to finish."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"We're the pair who ate ryotei food together in Tokyo, aren't we!"</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... Hee hee, that's right. 
{PAUSE ""}
Next time we go to the ryotei in Tokyo, let's empty <STYLE ID="15">Auntie</STYLE>'s wallet together."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Aha! Then next time let's really have that sushi-eating contest at the ryotei!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... I like that!"<PG>
