{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">―We got home and, utterly exhausted, slept like logs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">And then I had a dream.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
