{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">Me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">―and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">A dream of spending a happy time surrounded by the beautiful cherry trees blooming at the summit of Mount Itohime.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">These aren't </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Shigatsu Youka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, just ordinary cherry trees, the commonplace kind.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">Our family, who were never allowed even such ordinary happiness.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> is gone now, but I want to see the same sight with </STYLE><STYLE ID="16">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, the three of us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Close by, I'm sure I'll be able to feel </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">I'm no longer bound by the shadows of the past.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, I'm so glad I got to see you at the end.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">It's time I, too, moved on from </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'s phantom.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goodbye, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, I'm glad I'm your child.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Even now, I love </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> so much.</STYLE>
